<title>INDIA: India zinc production dips, lead output up in Oct.</title>
<headline>India zinc production dips, lead output up in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 10,867 tonnes of zinc in October against a target of 14,600 tonnes, the government said on Monday.</p>
<p>It produced 4,200 tonnes of lead in October against a target of 3,665 tonnes.</p>
<p>	     Annual	   October 1996	  Cumulative</p>
<p>	    installed     Target   Actual	 production</p>
<p>	    capacity			     Apr-Oct 96 Apr-Oct 95</p>
<p>    ZINC  169,000	  14,400  10,867   75,052     74,750</p>
<p>    LEAD   89,000	   3,665   4,200   23,482     22,571</p>
